<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Steinberg (1963) Differential Adhesion Interfacial Tension & Equal-Adhesion Null Identity" ;
    dct:description "Defines effective tissue interfacial tensions from microscopic Potts bond energies and proves that equal adhesion eliminates the sorting driving force | Variables: J_{AA}, J_{BB}, J_{AB}: homotypic and heterotypic Potts bond energies; J_{AM}, J_{BM}: cell-medium bond energies; γ_{AB}: heterotypic interfacial tension" ;
    dct:source "Steinberg (1963) Science 141(3579):401-408; Graner & Glazier (1992) Phys. Rev. Lett. 69(13):2013-2016 Eqs. (2)-(3)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1964-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting.py#L137-L183>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_041_differential_adhesion_sorting.lean#L17-L43> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def two_gamma_AB (J_AA J_BB J_AB : Int) : Int :=
  2 * J_AB - (J_AA + J_BB)
theorem steinberg_equal_adhesion_zero_tension (J J_M : Int) :
    two_gamma_AB J J J = 0 ∧ two_spreading_diff J J J_M J_M = 0"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "γ_{AB} = J_{AB} - (J_{AA} + J_{BB})/2,  γ_{τM} = J_{τM} - J_{ττ}/2;  J_{AA} = J_{BB} = J_{AB} ⇒ γ_{AB} = 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/jez.1401730406>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cpc.2007.03.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1088/1367-2630/13/3/033035>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevE.47.2128>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.69.2013>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.75.2244>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.141.3579.401>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.122.5.1611> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Differential Adhesion Cellular Potts Sorting (Steinberg DAH & Glazier-Graner-Hogeweg Hamiltonian)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.two_gamma_AB" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.steinberg_equal_adhesion_zero_tension" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Graner & Glazier (1992) Four Thermodynamic Phase Inequalities (Checkerboard, Complete Engulfment, Partial Engulfment, Dissociation)" ;
    dct:description "Partitions adhesion parameter space into checkerboard mixing, concentric complete engulfment sorting, partial engulfment lens doublets, and cell dissociation | Variables: γ_{AB}: heterotypic interfacial tension; γ_{AM}, γ_{BM}: tissue-medium surface tensions for outer shell A and inner core B" ;
    dct:source "Graner & Glazier (1992) Phys. Rev. Lett. 69(13):2013-2016 p. 2014; Glazier & Graner (1993) Phys. Rev. E 47(3):2128-2154 Table I" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1964-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting.py#L284-L560>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_041_differential_adhesion_sorting.lean#L45-L65> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """theorem graner_glazier_1992_complete_engulfment_inequalities :
    two_gamma_AB 14 2 11 = 6 ∧
    two_spreading_diff 14 2 16 16 = 12 ∧
    (0 < two_gamma_AB 14 2 11 ∧ two_gamma_AB 14 2 11 < two_spreading_diff 14 2 16 16) ∧
    two_gamma_AB 14 14 4 < 0 ∧
    two_gamma_AB 14 2 16 > two_spreading_diff 14 2 16 16 ∧
    two_gamma_M 14 2 < 0"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "Checkerboard: γ_{AB} < 0;  Complete engulfment: 0 < γ_{AB} < γ_{BM} - γ_{AM};  Partial engulfment: γ_{AB} > γ_{BM} - γ_{AM} > 0;  Dissociation: γ_{AM} < 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/jez.1401730406>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cpc.2007.03.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1088/1367-2630/13/3/033035>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevE.47.2128>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.69.2013>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.75.2244>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.141.3579.401>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.122.5.1611> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Differential Adhesion Cellular Potts Sorting (Steinberg DAH & Glazier-Graner-Hogeweg Hamiltonian)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.two_spreading_diff" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.graner_glazier_1992_complete_engulfment_inequalities" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Foty & Steinberg (1996) Chick Embryo Surface Tension Transitive Envelopment Hierarchy & Potts Hamiltonian" ;
    dct:description "Governs stochastic Metropolis Monte Carlo cell sorting and proves transitive mutual envelopment across all 5 embryonic Gallus gallus tissues | Variables: H: Cellular Potts Hamiltonian; σ_{i,j}: cell spin ID; a_σ: cell area; A_0: target area; σ_tissue: equilibrium tissue surface tension (dyn/cm)" ;
    dct:source "Foty, Pfleger, Forgacs & Steinberg (1996) Development 122(5):1611-1620 Table 1 & Fig. 4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1964-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting.py#L1013-L1051>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_041_differential_adhesion_sorting.lean#L67-L106> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """theorem foty_1996_transitive_envelopment_hierarchy (sA sB sC : Int)
    (hAB : sB > sA) (hBC : sC > sB) :
    (sC > sA) ∧ ((sC - sA) = (sC - sB) + (sB - sA))
theorem potts_area_energy_equilibrium_zero (lam A0 : Int) :
    potts_area_energy lam A0 A0 = 0"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "H = ∑ J(τ(σ), τ(σ'))(1 - δ_{σ,σ'}) + λ ∑_{σ>0}(a_σ - A_0)^2;  σ_limb (20.1) > σ_pigment (12.6) > σ_heart (8.5) > σ_liver (4.6) > σ_retina (1.6) dyn/cm" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/jez.1401730406>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cpc.2007.03.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1088/1367-2630/13/3/033035>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevE.47.2128>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.69.2013>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.75.2244>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.141.3579.401>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.122.5.1611> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Differential Adhesion Cellular Potts Sorting (Steinberg DAH & Glazier-Graner-Hogeweg Hamiltonian)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.potts_area_energy" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.foty_1996_transitive_envelopment_hierarchy" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "(Pass 3) Parity-Sublattice Exactness of the 3D Sublattice-Parallel Cellular Potts Metropolis Sweep" ;
    dct:description "Justifies the vectorised 8-colour sublattice-parallel Metropolis update of simulate_potts_regime_3d: the 26-neighbour adhesion energy change of every simultaneously evaluated voxel is exact; only the volume term uses sub-sweep-start volumes (domain-parallel CPM approximation) | Variables: (x, y, z): integer voxel coordinates on the 64³ lattice; parity class = (x mod 2, y mod 2, z mod 2) — the 8 colours of the sublattice sweep" ;
    dct:source "Graner & Glazier (1992) Phys. Rev. Lett. 69(13):2013-2016 Eq. (1); Chen, Glazier, Izaguirre & Alber (2007) Comput. Phys. Commun. 176(11-12):670-681 (DOI not verified offline)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1964-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting.py#L646-L854>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_041_differential_adhesion_sorting.lean#L110-L123> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """theorem parity_sublattice_sites_not_moore_adjacent
    (x1 y1 z1 x2 y2 z2 : Int)
    (hx : x1 % 2 = x2 % 2) (hy : y1 % 2 = y2 % 2) (hz : z1 % 2 = z2 % 2)
    (hdist : x1 ≠ x2 ∨ y1 ≠ y2 ∨ z1 ≠ z2) :
    ¬ (x1 - x2 ≤ 1 ∧ x2 - x1 ≤ 1 ∧ y1 - y2 ≤ 1 ∧ y2 - y1 ≤ 1 ∧ z1 - z2 ≤ 1 ∧ z2 - z1 ≤ 1)"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "x₁ ≡ x₂, y₁ ≡ y₂, z₁ ≡ z₂ (mod 2) ∧ (x₁,y₁,z₁) ≠ (x₂,y₂,z₂)  ⇒  max(|Δx|,|Δy|,|Δz|) ≥ 2  (same-parity voxels are never Moore-adjacent, so simultaneous copy attempts have exact ΔH_adh)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/jez.1401730406>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cpc.2007.03.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1088/1367-2630/13/3/033035>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevE.47.2128>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.69.2013>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.75.2244>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.141.3579.401>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.122.5.1611> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Differential Adhesion Cellular Potts Sorting (Steinberg DAH & Glazier-Graner-Hogeweg Hamiltonian)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.parity_sublattice_sites_not_moore_adjacent" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.parity_sublattice_sites_not_moore_adjacent" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "(Pass 3) Cellular Potts Volume-Constraint Single-Voxel Increment & Restoring Sign" ;
    dct:description "The exact per-move volume/area energy increment evaluated by both the 2D (simulate_potts_regime) and 3D (simulate_potts_regime_3d) Metropolis solvers; its sign is the restoring force that keeps ⟨v⟩ near V₀ against the compressive cell–medium surface tension | Variables: v: current cell volume (3D) or area (2D) in lattice sites; V₀: target volume; λ: volume elasticity" ;
    dct:source "Graner & Glazier (1992) Phys. Rev. Lett. 69(13):2013-2016 Eq. (1), second (area) term; Glazier & Graner (1993) Phys. Rev. E 47(3):2128-2154" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1964-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting.py#L800-L811>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_041_differential_adhesion_sorting.lean#L125-L156> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def potts_volume_energy (lam v V0 : Int) : Int :=
  lam * ((v - V0) * (v - V0))
theorem potts_volume_energy_single_voxel_increment (lam v V0 : Int) :
    potts_volume_energy lam (v + 1) V0 - potts_volume_energy lam v V0 = lam * (2 * (v - V0) + 1)
theorem potts_volume_increment_sign (lam v V0 : Int) (hlam : 0 < lam) :
    (v < V0 → lam * (2 * (v - V0) + 1) < 0) ∧ (V0 ≤ v → 0 < lam * (2 * (v - V0) + 1))"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "E_vol(v) = λ (v − V₀)²;  E_vol(v+1) − E_vol(v) = λ (2 (v − V₀) + 1);  v < V₀ ⇒ ΔE < 0,  v ≥ V₀ ⇒ ΔE > 0  (λ > 0)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/jez.1401730406>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cpc.2007.03.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1088/1367-2630/13/3/033035>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevE.47.2128>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.69.2013>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.75.2244>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.141.3579.401>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.122.5.1611> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Differential Adhesion Cellular Potts Sorting (Steinberg DAH & Glazier-Graner-Hogeweg Hamiltonian)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.potts_volume_energy" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.potts_volume_energy_single_voxel_increment" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-6> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "(Pass 3) Sorting Kinetics — Logarithmic vs Power-Law Heterotypic Boundary Decay, 2D vs 3D" ;
    dct:description "Empirical kinetic comparison requested by the Pass 2 audit: exponent α measured on the native 2D model, the full 3D (64³) boundary, the 2D equatorial section of the 3D spheroid, a Kawasaki-swap ablation and a 3D equal-adhesion control (compare_2d_vs_3d_sorting_kinetics); no Lean statement because the fits are statistical, not algebraic | Variables: t: Monte Carlo Steps; α: power-law sorting exponent; R²_pow, R²_log: fit quality of the two descriptions on identical points" ;
    dct:source "Graner & Glazier (1992) PRL Fig. 3 (logarithmic 2D decay); Mombach, Glazier, Raphael & Zajac (1995) PRL 75(11):2244; Nakajima & Ishihara (2011) New J. Phys. 13:033035 (DOIs not verified offline); Lifshitz–Slyozov–Wagner coarsening theory" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1964-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting.py#L486-L525> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:notation "f(t) = L_AB/L_tot;  logarithmic: f = a + b ln(t+1);  power law: f = c (t+1)^(−α);  LSW diffusive bound α = 1/3 (R ~ t^{1/3} ⇒ L_AB/L ~ t^{−1/3}); logarithmic limit α → 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/jez.1401730406>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cpc.2007.03.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1088/1367-2630/13/3/033035>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevE.47.2128>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.69.2013>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.75.2244>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.141.3579.401>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.122.5.1611> ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Differential Adhesion Cellular Potts Sorting (Steinberg DAH & Glazier-Graner-Hogeweg Hamiltonian)" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Steinberg (1963) Differential Adhesion Interfacial Tension & Equal-Adhesion Null Identity" ;
    dct:description "Defines effective tissue interfacial tensions from microscopic Potts bond energies and proves that equal adhesion eliminates the sorting driving force | Variables: J_{AA}, J_{BB}, J_{AB}: homotypic and heterotypic Potts bond energies; J_{AM}, J_{BM}: cell-medium bond energies; γ_{AB}: heterotypic interfacial tension" ;
    dct:source "Steinberg (1963) Science 141(3579):401-408; Graner & Glazier (1992) Phys. Rev. Lett. 69(13):2013-2016 Eqs. (2)-(3)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1964-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting.py#L137-L183>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_041_differential_adhesion_sorting.lean#L17-L43> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def two_gamma_AB (J_AA J_BB J_AB : Int) : Int :=
  2 * J_AB - (J_AA + J_BB)
theorem steinberg_equal_adhesion_zero_tension (J J_M : Int) :
    two_gamma_AB J J J = 0 ∧ two_spreading_diff J J J_M J_M = 0"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "γ_{AB} = J_{AB} - (J_{AA} + J_{BB})/2,  γ_{τM} = J_{τM} - J_{ττ}/2;  J_{AA} = J_{BB} = J_{AB} ⇒ γ_{AB} = 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/jez.1401730406>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cpc.2007.03.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1088/1367-2630/13/3/033035>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevE.47.2128>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.69.2013>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.75.2244>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.141.3579.401>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.122.5.1611> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Differential Adhesion Cellular Potts Sorting (Steinberg DAH & Glazier-Graner-Hogeweg Hamiltonian)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.two_gamma_AB" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.steinberg_equal_adhesion_zero_tension" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Graner & Glazier (1992) Four Thermodynamic Phase Inequalities (Checkerboard, Complete Engulfment, Partial Engulfment, Dissociation)" ;
    dct:description "Partitions adhesion parameter space into checkerboard mixing, concentric complete engulfment sorting, partial engulfment lens doublets, and cell dissociation | Variables: γ_{AB}: heterotypic interfacial tension; γ_{AM}, γ_{BM}: tissue-medium surface tensions for outer shell A and inner core B" ;
    dct:source "Graner & Glazier (1992) Phys. Rev. Lett. 69(13):2013-2016 p. 2014; Glazier & Graner (1993) Phys. Rev. E 47(3):2128-2154 Table I" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1964-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting.py#L284-L560>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_041_differential_adhesion_sorting.lean#L45-L65> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """theorem graner_glazier_1992_complete_engulfment_inequalities :
    two_gamma_AB 14 2 11 = 6 ∧
    two_spreading_diff 14 2 16 16 = 12 ∧
    (0 < two_gamma_AB 14 2 11 ∧ two_gamma_AB 14 2 11 < two_spreading_diff 14 2 16 16) ∧
    two_gamma_AB 14 14 4 < 0 ∧
    two_gamma_AB 14 2 16 > two_spreading_diff 14 2 16 16 ∧
    two_gamma_M 14 2 < 0"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "Checkerboard: γ_{AB} < 0;  Complete engulfment: 0 < γ_{AB} < γ_{BM} - γ_{AM};  Partial engulfment: γ_{AB} > γ_{BM} - γ_{AM} > 0;  Dissociation: γ_{AM} < 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/jez.1401730406>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cpc.2007.03.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1088/1367-2630/13/3/033035>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevE.47.2128>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.69.2013>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.75.2244>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.141.3579.401>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.122.5.1611> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Differential Adhesion Cellular Potts Sorting (Steinberg DAH & Glazier-Graner-Hogeweg Hamiltonian)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.two_spreading_diff" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.graner_glazier_1992_complete_engulfment_inequalities" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Foty & Steinberg (1996) Chick Embryo Surface Tension Transitive Envelopment Hierarchy & Potts Hamiltonian" ;
    dct:description "Governs stochastic Metropolis Monte Carlo cell sorting and proves transitive mutual envelopment across all 5 embryonic Gallus gallus tissues | Variables: H: Cellular Potts Hamiltonian; σ_{i,j}: cell spin ID; a_σ: cell area; A_0: target area; σ_tissue: equilibrium tissue surface tension (dyn/cm)" ;
    dct:source "Foty, Pfleger, Forgacs & Steinberg (1996) Development 122(5):1611-1620 Table 1 & Fig. 4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1964-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting.py#L1013-L1051>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_041_differential_adhesion_sorting.lean#L67-L106> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """theorem foty_1996_transitive_envelopment_hierarchy (sA sB sC : Int)
    (hAB : sB > sA) (hBC : sC > sB) :
    (sC > sA) ∧ ((sC - sA) = (sC - sB) + (sB - sA))
theorem potts_area_energy_equilibrium_zero (lam A0 : Int) :
    potts_area_energy lam A0 A0 = 0"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "H = ∑ J(τ(σ), τ(σ'))(1 - δ_{σ,σ'}) + λ ∑_{σ>0}(a_σ - A_0)^2;  σ_limb (20.1) > σ_pigment (12.6) > σ_heart (8.5) > σ_liver (4.6) > σ_retina (1.6) dyn/cm" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/jez.1401730406>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cpc.2007.03.007>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1088/1367-2630/13/3/033035>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevE.47.2128>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.69.2013>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.75.2244>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.141.3579.401>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.122.5.1611> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Differential Adhesion Cellular Potts Sorting (Steinberg DAH & Glazier-Graner-Hogeweg Hamiltonian)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.potts_area_energy" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_041.foty_1996_transitive_envelopment_hierarchy" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

