    dct:source "Graner & Glazier (1992) Phys. Rev. Lett. 69(13):2013-2016 Eq. (1); Chen, Glazier, Izaguirre & Alber (2007) Comput. Phys. Commun. 176(11-12):670-681 (DOI not verified offline)" ;
